    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/1.png?t=1748324663\" /></span><br><strong>WORLD WAR NEXT IS IN ACTIVE DEVELOPMENT WITH NEW UPDATES EVERY WEEK AND A NEW MAP EVERY TWO WEEKS. WE FIX ALL REPORTED BUGS &amp; ISSUES. WE RELY ON COMMUNITY INVOLVEMENT TO HELP DECIDE WHICH FEATURES AND IMPROVEMENTS SHOULD COME NEXT.</strong><br><br>World War Next is a low poly multiplayer FPS set during a World War 3 conflict. Team up in squads to battle it out on real-world locations like Odesa Port, Donbas, and Taiwan. Maps aim to focus on the Eastern European, South Pacific and Middle Eastern theatres. Choose from over 25 countries and vehicles like tanks, helicopters, boats and armored cars help players get around fast.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/2b9676775c71f77217a607b112fc03b2.poster.avif?t=1748324663\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/2b9676775c71f77217a607b112fc03b2.webm?t=1748324663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/2b9676775c71f77217a607b112fc03b2.mp4?t=1748324663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>We've built the core gameplay features of World War Next and are now focused on adding more higher polished maps based on real locations, optimizing, improving player count and adding popular features that the community requests.<br><br><strong>WHATS NEXT?</strong><br><br>The full version of World War Next will focus on the features the players love the most. The goal is to find the perfect balance between casual and tactical FPS.<br><br>We want to improve on our humble offering of maps by adding more higher polished, higher quality maps, both large and small. The maps will be based on real possible World War 3 battle locations in the Pacific Theatre, Eastern European Theatre and Middle Eastern Theatre.<br><br>We want to improve support for more players, first 32 then 50+. We will add support for proximity voice chat with more weapons and a weapon levelling system.  We want tighter vehicle controls with smoother, more optimized gameplay. We'll add more game modes and a completed UI/UX.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/2.png?t=1748324663\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/6c46293e4380a4bdd6beb773b423ccd8.poster.avif?t=1748324663\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/6c46293e4380a4bdd6beb773b423ccd8.webm?t=1748324663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/6c46293e4380a4bdd6beb773b423ccd8.mp4?t=1748324663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>COMMUNITY</strong><br><br>The community is the heart and soul of World War Next. The community will vote on which maps are next, which theatres and countries to focus on and what authentic tanks, planes, boats and weapons should be remade in low poly.<br><br>Our Discord server is the main hub for interactions. By joining, you can share feedback, report bugs, find squad members and engage with other players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/e8fa25be8976817c4301171ae1201fee.poster.avif?t=1748324663\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/e8fa25be8976817c4301171ae1201fee.webm?t=1748324663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/e8fa25be8976817c4301171ae1201fee.mp4?t=1748324663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>By being low poly, World War Next has the unique opportunity of being able to release an entirely new map within a week or two of a real battle breaking out. Being this adaptable allows us to stay on top of breaking news and create an experience unlike anything seen before. <strong>A live game to reflect the World War 3 conflict featuring authentic maps, vehicles, weapons, and uniforms \u2013 all in glorious low poly.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/3.png?t=1748324663\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/24c22b7e47c894fc353a89a2220a3c13.poster.avif?t=1748324663\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/24c22b7e47c894fc353a89a2220a3c13.webm?t=1748324663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/24c22b7e47c894fc353a89a2220a3c13.mp4?t=1748324663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/1.png?t=1748324663\" /></span><br><strong>WORLD WAR NEXT IS IN ACTIVE DEVELOPMENT WITH NEW UPDATES EVERY WEEK AND A NEW MAP EVERY TWO WEEKS. WE FIX ALL REPORTED BUGS &amp; ISSUES. WE RELY ON COMMUNITY INVOLVEMENT TO HELP DECIDE WHICH FEATURES AND IMPROVEMENTS SHOULD COME NEXT.</strong><br><br>World War Next is a low poly multiplayer FPS set during a World War 3 conflict. Team up in squads to battle it out on real-world locations like Odesa Port, Donbas, and Taiwan. Maps aim to focus on the Eastern European, South Pacific and Middle Eastern theatres. Choose from over 25 countries and vehicles like tanks, helicopters, boats and armored cars help players get around fast.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/2b9676775c71f77217a607b112fc03b2.poster.avif?t=1748324663\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/2b9676775c71f77217a607b112fc03b2.webm?t=1748324663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/2b9676775c71f77217a607b112fc03b2.mp4?t=1748324663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>We've built the core gameplay features of World War Next and are now focused on adding more higher polished maps based on real locations, optimizing, improving player count and adding popular features that the community requests.<br><br><strong>WHATS NEXT?</strong><br><br>The full version of World War Next will focus on the features the players love the most. The goal is to find the perfect balance between casual and tactical FPS.<br><br>We want to improve on our humble offering of maps by adding more higher polished, higher quality maps, both large and small. The maps will be based on real possible World War 3 battle locations in the Pacific Theatre, Eastern European Theatre and Middle Eastern Theatre.<br><br>We want to improve support for more players, first 32 then 50+. We will add support for proximity voice chat with more weapons and a weapon levelling system.  We want tighter vehicle controls with smoother, more optimized gameplay. We'll add more game modes and a completed UI/UX.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/2.png?t=1748324663\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/6c46293e4380a4bdd6beb773b423ccd8.poster.avif?t=1748324663\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/6c46293e4380a4bdd6beb773b423ccd8.webm?t=1748324663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/6c46293e4380a4bdd6beb773b423ccd8.mp4?t=1748324663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>COMMUNITY</strong><br><br>The community is the heart and soul of World War Next. The community will vote on which maps are next, which theatres and countries to focus on and what authentic tanks, planes, boats and weapons should be remade in low poly.<br><br>Our Discord server is the main hub for interactions. By joining, you can share feedback, report bugs, find squad members and engage with other players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667500/extras/e8fa25be8976817c4301171ae1201fee.poster.avif?t=1748324663\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https: